      "reading": "たいいんしましたが、びょうきがなおってたいいんしたわけではないんです。",
      "credits_raw": "rubyhatchet",
      "translations": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "text": "I was discharged from the hospital, but it doesn't mean I was cured and discharged.",
          "html": "<span>I was discharged from the hospital, but it doesn't mean I was cured and discharged. </span>",
